WEBVTT

00:06:59.633 --> 00:07:02.648
po tipi gjenetik i quajtur 577R?

00:07:02.648 --> 00:07:07.348
Sic duket, cdo sportist Olimpik i testuar

00:07:07.348 --> 00:07:10.598
posedon nje prej ketyre varianteve.

00:07:10.598 --> 00:07:12.252
Nese kjo eshte e vertete,

00:07:12.252 --> 00:07:14.410
na ben te kemi pyetje te komplikuara

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:16.211
per Olimpiaden e Londres.

00:07:16.211 --> 00:07:17.730
Tri opsione:

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:20.562
A deshironi qe Olimpiada te jete nje vitrine

00:07:20.562 --> 00:07:23.262
per mutante punetore?

00:07:23.262 --> 00:07:24.995
(Te qeshura)

00:07:24.995 --> 00:07:27.730
Opsioni i dyte:

00:07:27.730 --> 00:07:31.128
Pse nuk luajme sikur ne golf apo lundrim?